    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 Created by Giants who fled Einhasad's rage, this living organism was evolved from the Monster Eye. After the punishment of the Gods ended, Gorgolos turned its vicious teeth on its creators. Magic Creatures Lv. 2 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Magic Creatures. P. Def. +5% Max HP +3% Received Critical Damage -10% Received M. Crit. Damage -10% Resistance to Bleed +20% Resistance to Bow +10% Resistance to Crossbow +10% Speed -5 Resistance to Blunt -10% Resistance to Dual Blunt -10% Wind Attack Vulnerability Lv. 1 Vulnerable to Wind attacks. Bow/Crossbow Vulnerability Lv. 1 Weak against Bow/Crossbow attacks. Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
